ffect the resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0584":{"code":"F-0584","title":"Honor the resident's right to a safe, clean, comfortable and homelike environment, including but not limited to receiving treatment and supports for daily living safely.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0602":{"code":"F-0602","title":"Protect each resident from the wrongful use of the resident's belongings or money.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0661":{"code":"F-0661","title":"Ensure necessary information is communicated to the resident, and receiving health care provider at the time of a planned discharge.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0880":{"code":"F-0880","title":"Provide and implement an infection prevention and control program.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-f0814":{"code":"F-0814","title":"Dispose of garbage and refuse properly.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0625":{"code":"F-0625","title":"Notify the resident or the resident’s representative in writing how long the nursing home will hold the resident’s bed in cases of transfer to a hospital or therapeutic leave.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0692":{"code":"F-0692","title":"Provide enough food/fluids to maintain a resident's health.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinica